1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:04,781
Narration: Meet EchoFlow. Teach it once, then just ask.

2
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:09,224
Request: Order a Garlic Bread on Domino's.

3
00:00:10,451 --> 00:00:17,235
EchoFlow: I don't know how to "order a garlic bread on Domino's" yet. Want to teach me? Say yes, then show me.

4
00:00:17,615 --> 00:00:19,287
Request: Yes.

5
00:00:21,768 --> 00:00:27,033
EchoFlow: Okay, show me in Domino's. Tap Done when you're finished. I never pay.

6
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:33,753
Narration: We show it once: search for garlic bread, add it, and open the cart.

7
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:56,463
EchoFlow: Learned: order a garlic bread on dominos. I saved 4 steps. You can change the item.

8
00:00:56,463 --> 00:00:58,712
EchoFlow: You can see it in the EchoFlow app.

9
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:05,570
Narration: One demonstration, saved as a lesson. Now, the exact same request.

10
00:01:07,573 --> 00:01:10,757
Request: Order a Garlic Bread on Domino's.

11
00:01:11,917 --> 00:01:14,580
EchoFlow: Okay, order a garlic bread on dominos.

12
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:22,900
Narration: It replays the lesson by itself, and stops at payment. Paying is always up to you.

13
00:01:35,748 --> 00:01:41,567
EchoFlow: Your turn. Everything is ready for payment. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

14
00:01:49,450 --> 00:01:52,066
Narration: Now different words, for the same task.

15
00:01:54,631 --> 00:01:57,695
Request: Get me garlic bread from Domino's.

16
00:01:58,842 --> 00:02:01,527
EchoFlow: Okay, order a garlic bread on dominos.

17
00:02:03,050 --> 00:02:09,122
Narration: It understands the new wording on the phone, and sees the garlic bread is already in the cart.

18
00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:26,300
EchoFlow: Garlic bread was already in your cart, so I didn't add another one. Your turn.

19
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:31,548
EchoFlow: Everything is ready for payment. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

20
00:02:37,050 --> 00:02:40,994
Narration: Next, a new item, and a quantity it was never shown.

21
00:02:43,867 --> 00:02:47,315
Request: Order two Choco Lava Cakes on Domino's.

22
00:02:48,521 --> 00:02:51,514
EchoFlow: Okay, order 2 choco lava cake on dominos.

23
00:02:53,250 --> 00:03:00,336
Narration: Two choco lava cakes, from a single garlic bread lesson. It sets the quantity in the cart itself.

24
00:03:14,208 --> 00:03:20,031
EchoFlow: Your turn. Everything is ready for payment. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

25
00:03:27,650 --> 00:03:30,170
Narration: Finally, a dish that doesn't exist.

26
00:03:32,916 --> 00:03:36,340
Request: Order a unicorn pizza on Domino's.

27
00:03:37,575 --> 00:03:40,551
EchoFlow: Okay, order a unicorn pizza on dominos.

28
00:03:52,946 --> 00:03:57,826
EchoFlow: I searched for "unicorn pizza" but couldn't find it. What should I get instead?

29
00:03:58,190 --> 00:03:59,862
Request: Nothing.

30
00:04:01,100 --> 00:04:07,154
EchoFlow: I searched for "unicorn pizza" but couldn't find it. So I stopped at step 3 without adding anything.

31
00:04:08,650 --> 00:04:13,237
Narration: It asks, instead of guessing, and stops without adding anything.

32
00:04:19,136 --> 00:04:21,600
Request: Did the last run succeed?

33
00:04:22,806 --> 00:04:24,941
EchoFlow: No, the last run didn't succeed.

34
00:04:24,941 --> 00:04:29,743
EchoFlow: Order a unicorn pizza on dominos stopped at step 3 of 4 (Tap "btn add").

35
00:04:29,743 --> 00:04:36,414
EchoFlow: I searched for "unicorn pizza" but couldn't find it. So I stopped at step 3 without adding anything.

36
00:04:37,450 --> 00:04:42,362
Narration: Teach once. Ask any way. Payment stays with you.
